# ============================================================
# GrowingVegetation_Flow.graph
# Unity Visual Scripting  –  FlowGraph Node Specification
#
# ARCHITECTURE CONTRACT:
#   Update() Vector3.Lerp math, ApplyColorTint() shader/material
#   loops, and VegetationManager polling stay in C#.
#   VS reads GrowthProgress for growth-stage reactions.
#
# NODE MAP:
#   [Update] → [GetComponent<GrowingVegetation>]
#     → [GetMember: GrowthProgress] → float
#     → [Branch: GrowthProgress >= 1.0 AND prevProgress < 1.0]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnVegetationFullyGrown"]
#     → [Branch: GrowthProgress >= 0.5 AND prevProgress < 0.5]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnVegetationHalfGrown"]
#   [Set Variable: prevProgress = GrowthProgress]
#
# CUSTOM EVENTS:
#   "OnVegetationHalfGrown"  → enable subtle sway animation
#   "OnVegetationFullyGrown" → add to biomass contribution tally
#
# MACHINE SETUP:
#   ScriptMachine on vegetation prefab root alongside GrowingVegetation
# ============================================================